<stack-static>
    <statement><p><p>For each function below, decide whether it is an integral of <m>f(x) = {3 x^2+2}</m>.</p><p>Differentiate each function to decide.</p><ol><li><div><m>{x^3+2}</m> [ is an integral | is not an integral ] </div></li><li><div><m>{6 x}</m> [ is an integral | is not an integral ] </div></li><li><div><m>{x^3+2 x-1}</m> [ is an integral | is not an integral ] </div></li><li><div><m>{3 x^3+2 x}</m> [ is an integral | is not an integral ] </div></li><li><div><m>{x^3+2 x+4}</m> [ is an integral | is not an integral ] </div></li></ol><div/></p></statement>
    <solution><p><p>A function is an integral of <m>f(x)</m> exactly when its derivative is <m>f(x)</m>. Every integral of <m>f(x) = {3 x^2+2}</m> has the form <m>{x^3+2 x} + c</m>: adding a constant changes nothing, because a constant differentiates to <m>0</m>.</p><tabular border="1" style="border-collapse:collapse;text-align:center;"><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Function</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">Its derivative</cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">An integral of <m>f(x)</m>?</cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{x^3+2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{3 x^2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">no</cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{6 x}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{6}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">no</cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{x^3+2 x-1}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{3 x^2+2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">yes</cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{3 x^3+2 x}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{9 x^2+2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">no</cell></row><row><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{x^3+2 x+4}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;"><m>{3 x^2+2}</m></cell><cell style="padding:4px 10px;">yes</cell></row></tabular></p></solution>
    <answer><p>is not an integral</p></answer>
    <answer><p>is not an integral</p></answer>
    <answer><p>is an integral</p></answer>
    <answer><p>is not an integral</p></answer>
    <answer><p>is an integral</p></answer>
</stack-static>